stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Empty
  Empty --> Loading: bootstrap
  Loading --> Ready: baseline verified
  Ready --> Stale: canonical change
  Stale --> Updating: targeted delta
  Updating --> Ready: checkpoint committed
  Loading --> Degraded: partial source
  Updating --> Degraded: recoverable failure
  Loading --> Failed: unusable
  Updating --> Failed: integrity failure
  Degraded --> Updating: retry
  Failed --> Loading: controlled rebuild

